name:Litaniae Sanctorum: Sancta Maria, Sancta Dei Genitrix, Sancta Virgo virginum, ora pro nobis;
office-part:Litaniae;
mode:;
book:Processionarium O.P. (Cormier), 1913, p. 126 (Litaniae Sanctorum);
transcriber:set for this site from the scan of the Processionarium O.P. 1913;
commentary:the three invocations are printed under the one formula on p. 126 and set to it as the book lines them up (Sanc-ta Ma-rí-a: the accent on A, Gé-ni-trix, Vír-gi-num: the accent on A, the two syllables after it on G);
